  "term": "me",
  "definition": "ME refers to myalgic encephalomyelitis, also described here as ME/CFS. In this source, it is presented as a disabling condition whose uncertain causes, varied diagnostic definitions, and history of being mischaracterized as psychosomatic create important ethical and practical challenges for research, including the need to reduce participant burden and build trust with affected communities.",
